#: SearchPlugin.cpp:2283
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Transform and export search matches using a replacement pattern. To export "
"the whole matches, use \\0. To export regular expression captures, use \\1,"
"\\2,... The other text in the pattern is returned in the export results."
msgstr ""
"Transformér og eksporter søgematch ved hjælp af et erstatningsmønster. Brug "
"\\0 for at eksportere hele matchet. Brug \\1,\\2,... for at eksportere "
"opsamlinger fra regulære udtryk. Øvrig tekst i mønsteret returneres i "
"eksportresultaterne."

